# Win5 verify — stop gate

Source of truth: `.sim/VERIFY-DOD.txt`.

That file is the **minimum**, not the whole product.
If you already saw a defect and it is missing from the file, **append it**.
Do not ignore a bug because nobody wrote the line yet.

Forbidden:
- Ending with any `[ ]` open after claiming verify work
- Writing “没做 / 已知问题 / 以后再说” as the delivery
- Skipping GUI, VT, or TUI 60/100/200 because a previous session failed
- Treating pytest or SVG export as visual proof
- Real frzr on a host disk (`INSTALLER_ALLOW_REAL_FRZR` unset)

Required before any “done”:
- Every line in `.sim/VERIFY-DOD.txt` is `[x]` with an evidence path
- TUI/GUI PNGs opened with the Read tool (not filenames)
- Simulation only: `INSTALLER_SIMULATION=1` + stubs; GUI uses `flow.disk` sim gates
